#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:74
#: c4eaa8bc32ab4458806cd3009131b1bb
msgid ""
"FaSim `submodules_visibility.conf` marks Galbot **public** and the "
"FiveAges Gen\\* / Ubtech trees **private**, so `./init.sh` does not "
"select FiveAges by default. The **remotes** for Gen1 (`fiveages-gen1"
"-robot-usds`) and Gen2 (`fiveages-gen2-robot-usds`) are now public; Gen3 "
"is still private. **W2R and S2R are not in the Gen2 USD repo.** In-tree "
"(not submodule) categories on robot_usds include grippers, dexhands, "
"manipulators, mobile bases, mobile manipulators, and sensors — browse the"
" repo for the current roots."
msgstr ""
"FaSim `submodules_visibility.conf`把 Galbot 标成 **public**，FiveAges Gen\\* /"
"Ubtech 树标成 **private**，因此 `./init.sh`默认不勾选"
"FiveAges。Gen1（`fiveages-gen1-robot-usds`）与"
"Gen2（`fiveages-gen2-robot-usds`）的**远端**现已公开；Gen3 仍为私有。**W2R 与 S2R 不在 Gen2"
"USD 仓库中。** robot_usds 树内（非子模块）类别包括夹爪、灵巧手、机械臂、移动底盘、移动机械臂和传感器 — 以仓库当前根目录为准。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:76
#: ffa0e4d826d84a049284d11626338679
msgid ""
"FiveAges **Gen1 / Gen2 / Gen3** are wheeled-arm USD generations under "
"`humanoid/FiveAges/` (README maps Gen1→W1, Gen2→W2/S2). They are not "
"bipedal humanoids. URDF status: [FiveAges robot "
"descriptions](../../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)."
msgstr ""
"FiveAges **Gen1 / Gen2 / Gen3** 是 `humanoid/FiveAges/`下的轮臂 USD"
"世代（README：Gen1→W1，Gen2→W2/S2）。它们不是双足人形。URDF 状态：[FiveAges"
"机器人描述](../../4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md)。"

